      "x": 40,
      "y": 2424,
      "src": "n_contables son las barras dentro de 0,5·h_ef de un perno traccionado, medido en planta: NO son\nlas n_barras del pedestal. T_grupo es la traccion del grupo con que se corrio el anclaje, y\nAs_req_anc la armadura de anclaje que exige anclaje-hormigon-generica: ella la dimensiona por la\nCAPACIDAD del perno (fusible), y es la que manda cuando supera a la de la demanda."
    },
    {
      "id": "in_h_ef",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2544,
      "src": "h_ef := 1250 mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "in_n_contables",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2590,
      "src": "n_contables := 13"
    },
    {
      "id": "in_T_grupo",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2636,
      "src": "T_grupo := 3267.9 kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "in_As_req_anc",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2682,
      "src": "As_req_anc := 6678 mm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r205",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2728,
      "src": "━━ DATOS · CATEGORIA SISMICA ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r206",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2774,
      "src": "sdc_def := 1 si la estructura es de SDC D, E o F (18.13.2.1): rigen 18.13.2.2 y 18.13.2.3 en la\nunion del pedestal con la zapata. := 0 si no."
    },
    {
      "id": "in_sdc_def",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2846,
      "src": "sdc_def := 1"
    },
    {
      "id": "r043",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2892,
      "src": "━━ DERIVADOS · SECCION Y ACERO ━━",
      "pageBreak": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r044",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2938,
      "src": "sqrt(f'c) no es dimensional: se adimensiona y se reconstituye con (1 MPa)"
    },
    {
      "id": "r045",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2984,
      "src": "fc_n := fc/(1 MPa) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r046",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3030,
      "src": "fy_n := fy/(1 MPa) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r047",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3076,
      "src": "raiz_fc := sqrt(fc_n) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r048",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3122,
      "src": "Ag := PED_X*PED_Y = mm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r049",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3168,
      "src": "area_barra := pi/4*db_long^2 = mm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r050",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3214,
      "src": "Ast := n_barras*area_barra = mm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r051",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3260,
      "src": "d_ped_X := PED_X - recub_ped = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r052",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3306,
      "src": "d_ped_Y := PED_Y - recub_ped = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r053",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3352,
      "src": "━━ CUANTIA LONGITUDINAL ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r054",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3398,
      "src": "As_min := rho_min_norma*Ag = mm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r055",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3444,
      "src": "As_max := rho_max_norma*Ag = mm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r056",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3490,
      "src": "rho_long := Ast/Ag ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_cuantia_min",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3536,
      "src": "v_cuantia_min := Ast >= As_min ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_cuantia_max",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3582,
      "src": "v_cuantia_max := Ast <= As_max ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r059",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3628,
      "src": "u_cuantia := As_min/Ast ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r060",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3674,
      "src": "━━ EXTREMOS DEL DIAGRAMA DE INTERACCION ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r061",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3720,
      "src": "§22.4.2.2: P_o = 0,85·f'c·(Ag - Ast) + fy·Ast"
    },
    {
      "id": "r062",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3766,
      "src": "Po := 0.85*fc*(Ag - Ast) + fy*Ast = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r063",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3812,
      "src": "§22.4.2.1 con estribos: phi·P_n,max = 0,80·phi·P_o. Tabla 21.2.2: phi = 0,65\nen seccion controlada por compresion con estribos, y 0,90 en traccion pura"
    },
    {
      "id": "r064",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3884,
      "src": "phi_comp := 0.65"
    },
    {
      "id": "r065",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3930,
      "src": "phiPn_max := 0.80*phi_comp*Po = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r066",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3976,
      "src": "phi_trac := 0.90"
    },
    {
      "id": "r067",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4022,
      "src": "phiPnt := phi_trac*fy*Ast = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r068",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4068,
      "src": "u_comp := N_comp_max/phiPn_max ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r069",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4114,
      "src": "u_trac := N_trac_max/phiPnt ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_comp",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4160,
      "src": "v_comp := u_comp <= 1 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_trac",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4206,
      "src": "v_trac := u_trac <= 1 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r072",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4252,
      "src": "━━ FLEXO-COMPRESION · phi·Mn declarado ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r073",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4298,
      "src": "u_pm_1 := Mu_1/phiMn_1 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r074",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4344,
      "src": "u_pm_2 := Mu_2/phiMn_2 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r075",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4390,
      "src": "u_pm_3 := Mu_3/phiMn_3 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r076",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4436,
      "src": "u_pm := max(u_pm_1, u_pm_2, u_pm_3) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_pm",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4482,
      "src": "v_pm := u_pm <= 1 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r202",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4528,
      "src": "━━ FLEXION BIAXIAL · contorno lineal ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r203",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4574,
      "src": "Suma lineal de usos uniaxiales con la misma axial. No es una ecuacion de la norma: es una COTA\nSUPERIOR por mecanica -la superficie de falla de una seccion con armadura simetrica es convexa,\nasi que la recta entre sus dos trazas uniaxiales queda por dentro-. Si no cumple, no quiere\ndecir que falle: hay que calcular el punto biaxial con una herramienta de seccion."
    },
    {
      "id": "r204",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4698,
      "src": "u_biax := Mu_X_b/phiMnX_b + Mu_Y_b/phiMnY_b ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_biax",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4744,
      "src": "v_biax := u_biax <= 1 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r078",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4790,
      "src": "━━ CORTE · Tabla 22.5.5.1 ecuacion (a) ━━",
      "pageBreak": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r079",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4836,
      "src": "Nota 1 de esa tabla: N_u es NEGATIVO en traccion, que es la condicion\ndesfavorable porque resta capacidad. Se toma la traccion maxima"
    },
    {
      "id": "r080",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4908,
      "src": "Nu := -N_trac_max = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r081",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4954,
      "src": "§22.5.5.1.2: el termino axial N_u/(6·Ag) no se toma mayor que 0,05·f'c —\nel tope solo muerde en compresion, pero la plantilla lo aplica igual"
    },
    {
      "id": "r082",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5026,
      "src": "term_axial := min(Nu/(6*Ag), 0.05*fc) = MPa"
    },
    {
      "id": "r083",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5072,
      "src": "vc_ped := 0.17*lam*raiz_fc*(1 MPa) + term_axial = MPa"
    },
    {
      "id": "r084",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5118,
      "src": "Con traccion suficiente v_c se anula y todo el corte pasa a los estribos:\nsi este chequeo no pasa, esta hoja no alcanza"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_vc_positivo",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5190,
      "src": "v_vc_positivo := vc_ped > 0 MPa ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r086",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5236,
      "src": "La misma tabla pone un techo de 0,42·lam·sqrt(f'c)"
    },
    {
      "id": "r087",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5282,
      "src": "vc_techo := 0.42*lam*raiz_fc*(1 MPa) = MPa"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_vc_techo",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5328,
      "src": "v_vc_techo := vc_ped <= vc_techo ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r089",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5374,
      "src": "Tabla 21.2.1 fila (b): corte, phi = 0,75"
    },
    {
      "id": "r090",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5420,
      "src": "phi_corte := 0.75"
    },
    {
      "id": "r091",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5466,
      "src": "Corte en X: la seccion que resiste tiene ancho PED_Y y canto util en X"
    },
    {
      "id": "r092",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5512,
      "src": "phiVc_X := phi_corte*vc_ped*PED_Y*d_ped_X = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r093",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5558,
      "src": "phiVc_Y := phi_corte*vc_ped*PED_X*d_ped_Y = kN"
    },
    {
      "id": "r094",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5604,
      "src": "u_corte_X := Vu_X/phiVc_X ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r095",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5650,
      "src": "u_corte_Y := Vu_Y/phiVc_Y ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_corte_X",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5696,
      "src": "v_corte_X := u_corte_X <= 1 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_corte_Y",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5742,
      "src": "v_corte_Y := u_corte_Y <= 1 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r098",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5788,
      "src": "━━ ESTRIBOS · minimo y separacion ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r099",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5834,
      "src": "§10.6.2.2: el 0,062·sqrt(f'c) y el 0,35 son coeficientes en MPa, no numeros.\nSe dimensiona sobre la cara larga, que es la que pide mas ramas"
    },
    {
      "id": "r100",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5906,
      "src": "Av_a := 0.062*raiz_fc*(1 MPa)*PED_Y*sep_est/fy = mm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r101",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5952,
      "src": "Av_b := 0.35*(1 MPa)*PED_Y*sep_est/fy = mm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r102",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5998,
      "src": "Av_min := max(Av_a, Av_b) = mm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r103",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6044,
      "src": "Av_prov := n_ramas*pi/4*db_est^2 = mm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_Av",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6090,
      "src": "v_Av := Av_prov >= Av_min ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r105",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6136,
      "src": "El §10.7.6.1.2 no da la separacion: remite al §25.7.2.1 para estribos. Es el\n(b), impresa 551, rasterizada 2026-08-19 — la menor de 16·db de la barra\nlongitudinal, 48·db del estribo y la dimension menor del elemento"
    },
    {
      "id": "r106",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6230,
      "src": "sep_est_max := min(16*db_long, 48*db_est, min(PED_X, PED_Y)) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_sep_est",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6276,
      "src": "v_sep_est := sep_est <= sep_est_max ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r108",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6322,
      "src": "§25.7.2.2, misma impresa 551: el estribo es al menos No. 10 encerrando barras\nNo. 32 o menores, y No. 13 encerrando No. 36 o mayores"
    },
    {
      "id": "r109",
      "kind": "program",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6394,
      "src": "db_est_min :=\n    if db_long <= 32 mm\n        return 10 mm\n    else\n        return 13 mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_db_est",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6532,
      "src": "v_db_est := db_est >= db_est_min ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r207",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6578,
      "src": "━━ UNION CON LA ZAPATA · §18.13.2 ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r208",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6624,
      "src": "18.13.2.2: la armadura longitudinal de columnas que resisten sismo se prolonga dentro de la zapata\ny desarrolla f_y en traccion EN LA INTERFAZ. 18.13.2.3: con base empotrada, si lleva ganchos, van a\n90 grados cerca del fondo de la zapata con el extremo libre hacia el centro de la columna. Es\ndetallado: la hoja lo declara, no lo calcula."
    },
    {
      "id": "r209",
      "kind": "program",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6748,
      "src": "detallado_18_13 :=\n    if sdc_def == 1\n        return \"RIGE 18.13.2.2 y 18.13.2.3: barras desarrolladas para fy en la interfaz, ganchos a 90 grados hacia el centro\"\n    else\n        return \"no rige 18.13.2 (SDC A, B o C)\""
    },
    {
      "id": "r111",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6898,
      "src": "━━ LA ARMADURA DEL PEDESTAL ES LA ARMADURA DE ANCLAJE ━━",
      "pageBreak": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r112",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6944,
      "src": "La traccion del grupo de pernos y la del lado traccionado del pedestal son el\nMISMO fenomeno: no hay doble conteo. Pero no cuentan todas las barras, solo\nlas que caen dentro del radio del cono"
    },
    {
      "id": "r113",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7038,
      "src": "radio_cono := 0.5*h_ef = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_contables",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7084,
      "src": "v_contables := n_contables <= n_barras ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r115",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7130,
      "src": "Tabla 21.2.1 fila (k), impresa 430, rasterizada: Anchor reinforcement in\naccordance with 17.5.2.1 — phi = 0,90. El §17.5.2.1.5, impresa 264, remite alli"
    },
    {
      "id": "r116",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7202,
      "src": "phi_anclaje := 0.90"
    },
    {
      "id": "r117",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7248,
      "src": "As_anclaje := max(T_grupo/(phi_anclaje*fy), As_req_anc) = mm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r118",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7294,
      "src": "n_req := ceil(As_anclaje/area_barra) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r119",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7340,
      "src": "u_anclaje := n_req/n_contables ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_anclaje",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7386,
      "src": "v_anclaje := u_anclaje <= 1 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r121",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7432,
      "src": "La cuantia TOTAL sobra sobre la requerida por anclaje, y eso es justamente lo\nque invita al error: lo que cuenta son las barras del cono"
    },
    {
      "id": "r122",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7504,
      "src": "Ast/As_anclaje ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r123",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7550,
      "src": "n_contables/n_barras ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r124",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7596,
      "src": "━━ QUE GOBIERNA ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r125",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7642,
      "src": "u_max := max(u_comp, u_trac, u_pm, u_biax, u_corte_X, u_corte_Y, u_anclaje) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r126",
      "kind": "program",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7688,
      "src": "gobierna :=\n    if u_max == u_anclaje\n        return \"armadura de anclaje: barras dentro del cono\"\n    else if u_max == u_biax\n        return \"flexion biaxial (contorno lineal)\"\n    else if u_max == u_pm\n        return \"flexo-compresion\"\n    else if u_max == u_corte_X\n        return \"corte en X del pedestal\"\n    else if u_max == u_corte_Y\n        return \"corte en Y del pedestal\"\n    else if u_max == u_comp\n        return \"compresion axial\"\n    else\n        return \"traccion axial\""
    },
    {
      "id": "v_global",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8054,
      "src": "v_global := u_max <= 1 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r128",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8100,
      "src": "La cuantia minima es un ratio de DETALLADO —exigida contra provista— y va\naparte: no dice cuanto falta para agotar la seccion"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_detallado",
      "kind": "math",
